(Saw cutting and reinstatement of a damaged asphalt carriageway patch adjacent to a live lane) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Reference: SF-TEMPLATE-001    Issue Date: 08 May 2026) Tj
T*
(Location: Local access road outside an industrial estate, Birmingham) Tj
T*
(Contractor: SafeFlow Demo Contractor) Tj
T*
(Review: Review this RAMS document quarterly and after any incident.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(?? SCOPE OF WORKS) Tj
T*
(The work involves saw cutting the damaged section of the carriageway and removing the) Tj
T*
(debris. The area will be reinstated with cold-lay asphalt after ensuring the subbase is) Tj
T*
(compact and level.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(?? SITE OBSERVATIONS) Tj
T*
(The photos show work being done with appropriate safety gear, though attention to dust) Tj
T*
(control is necessary. Traffic and pedestrian management with barriers and cones seems) Tj
T*
(adequate, but vigilance is required to ensure their effectiveness. Equipment appears) Tj
T*
(suitable for the task, although the proximity to live lanes highlights the need for proper) Tj
T*
(traffic control and visibility. Weather conditions seem clear, which should facilitate) Tj
T*
(operations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(?? HAZARD REGISTER & RISK ASSESSMENT) Tj
T*
(1. Live Traffic) Tj
T*
(   People at risk: Workers and pedestrians) Tj
T*
(   Initial: High \(5 x 5\)) Tj
T*
(   Controls: Deploy temporary traffic lights and barriers to separate the work area) Tj
T*
(   from live traffic lanes.) Tj
T*
(   Residual: Medium \(2 x 4\)) Tj
T*
(2. Dust/Silica Exposure) Tj
T*
(   People at risk: Workers and nearby pedestrians) Tj
T*
(   Initial: High \(4 x 4\)) Tj
T*
(   Controls: Use water suppression systems and provide masks to workers.) Tj
T*
(   Residual: Medium \(2 x 3\)) Tj
T*
(3. Noise) Tj
T*
(   People at risk: Workers) Tj
T*
(   Initial: High \(4 x 4\)) Tj
T*
(   Controls: Provide ear protection to all personnel on site.) Tj
T*
(   Residual: Low \(2 x 2\)) Tj
T*
(4. Manual Handling) Tj
T*
(   People at risk: Workers) Tj
T*
(   Initial: Medium \(4 x 3\)) Tj
T*
(   Controls: Train workers in manual handling techniques and use mechanical aids where) Tj
T*
(   possible.) Tj
T*
